@startuml
title OAuth2.0 授权码流程

actor 用户 as User
participant "第三方应用" as ThirdParty
participant "Oauth2认证中心" as AuthCenter
participant "资源中心" as ResourceCenter

User -> ThirdParty: 1. 点击"第三方登录"
ThirdParty -> AuthCenter: 2. 跳转到授权页面
AuthCenter -> User: 3. 登录平台账号
User -> AuthCenter: 4. 确认授权
AuthCenter -> ThirdParty: 5. 返回 code
ThirdParty -> AuthCenter: 6. 用 code + client_id + client_secret 换取 access_token
AuthCenter -> ThirdParty: 7. 返回 access_token
ThirdParty -> ResourceCenter: 8. 用 access_token 获取用户数据
ResourceCenter -> ThirdParty: 9. 返回 openid
ThirdParty -> User: 10. 生成会话 token，完成登录
@enduml